<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — ASMR Registry" description="How ASMR Registry handles your data. We use Google Analytics for traffic measurement and do not collect personal information." canonical="/privacy/">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 23, 2026</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>ASMR Registry does not require accounts, logins, or personal information. We do not collect names, email addresses, or payment information through this website.</p>

    <h2>Amazon affiliate links</h2>
    <p>ASMR Registry is a participant in the Amazon Associates Program. As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. If you click a link to Amazon, Amazon may use cookies to record that the visit came from this site. Amazon's own privacy notice applies on its site.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to measure aggregate traffic patterns — which pages are visited, how long sessions last, and which countries visitors come from. GA4 uses cookies to distinguish unique visitors. No personally identifiable information is stored or transmitted to us through GA4.</p>
    <p>You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses the following cookies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>_ga, _ga_*</strong> — Google Analytics measurement cookies. Used to distinguish visitors and track session data. Expire after 2 years.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense cookies</strong> — Used to serve and personalize ads. Set by Google (DoubleClick/Google Ad Manager). See Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">How Google uses cookies in advertising</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>Banner ads on this site are served by Adsterra inside separate frames. Adsterra and its advertisers may use cookies and similar technology to show and measure ads. See <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Adsterra's privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <p>We use Google AdSense (publisher ID: ca-pub-8997828618122077) to display ads on this site. Google AdSense uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Ad Settings</a>. For more information, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">How Google uses data when you use our partners' sites or apps</a>.</p>

    <h2>Embedded content</h2>
    <p>Video pages embed YouTube players via <code>youtube-nocookie.com</code> (YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode). YouTube may set its own cookies when you interact with the embedded player. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>YouTube API Services</h2>
    <p>Video titles, descriptions, lengths, view counts and channel names on this site come from the YouTube API Services. By using this site you also agree to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">YouTube Terms of Service</a>, and Google handles data under the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>. We do not collect or store any of your YouTube account data. Trigger, intent and intensity labels are our own classification, not data from YouTube. You can revoke any access you have granted to apps through Google at <a href="https://security.google.com/settings/security/permissions" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google security settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting and CDN. Cloudflare may log IP addresses for security and performance. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — web font delivery. Font files are loaded from Google's servers. See <a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Fonts Privacy FAQ</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising. Serves ads and uses cookies to personalize them. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain analytics data for 14 months (GA4 default). We do not store any user-submitted data as we have no forms, accounts, or user-generated content.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children. Our "For Kids" ASMR category curates age-appropriate content but does not target or collect data from minors.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as our services evolve. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@asmrregistry.com">hello@asmrregistry.com</a></p>
    <p>See also: <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a> · <a href="/about/">About ASMR Registry</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
